                                "target_word": "chickenfucker",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "029e1bc2-b704-3725-a0e7-0b1341ee2825",
                                        "entry_id": "076daecc-31da-3937-b524-d9da48f17a5d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Term of abuse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "slang",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "caf2f0f9-1508-4bac-bfe2-ec77b5afcd2b",
                                                "sense_id": "029e1bc2-b704-3725-a0e7-0b1341ee2825",
                                                "text": "That got me mad and I called them all chickenfuckers. That got them mad and they called the police. That's when I called it quits."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7031a76-0d39-4442-8ec0-5b80d622d29f",
                                                "sense_id": "029e1bc2-b704-3725-a0e7-0b1341ee2825",
                                                "text": "The extra insults, about being sons of whores and chickenfuckers, Jesse had tossed in free."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68a8b973-204c-483f-b573-fe7fceb07c47",
                                                "sense_id": "029e1bc2-b704-3725-a0e7-0b1341ee2825",
                                                "text": "... a 'fascist institution' (faschistische Struktur) dividing women into 'mothers and whores, “purified” by or punished for their sexuality with pregnancy',44 and referred to priests as 'pitiful chickenfuckers' (armselige Hühnerficker)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e24e2ec2-dc89-3ac2-9360-f84ddc289909",
                                        "entry_id": "076daecc-31da-3937-b524-d9da48f17a5d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who takes part in sexual activity with chickens."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "rare",
                                            "slang",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16baad50-4328-41cd-a670-8a8c57fe6724",
                                                "sense_id": "e24e2ec2-dc89-3ac2-9360-f84ddc289909",
                                                "text": "Yeah, \"Halfie\" I think it went that the cop was reading a note from the Chickenfucker, that said \"Sorry I had sex with your chickens\" or something. Then they said \"who would fuck a chicken\" and Halfie put up his hand. Then they said \"You don't count halfie, you don't have any legs\" But I think the middle part of my description is way wrong. Oh well"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc7b9b34-a4c9-46b7-a52f-27f7a64687b2",
                                                "sense_id": "e24e2ec2-dc89-3ac2-9360-f84ddc289909",
                                                "text": "I will speak for myself, thank you. The pedophile issue is raised solely to muddy the gay rights issue. As someone else said, it is a red herring. Are you suggesting that chickenfuckers are next and that if we sanction gay marriages then we have to sanction chickenfuckers? What the gay issue comes [...] reason. It has nothing to do with pedophiles. Or chickenfuckers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d92ee9b-6d2a-4f29-b021-865a9c6942e9",
                                                "sense_id": "e24e2ec2-dc89-3ac2-9360-f84ddc289909",
                                                "text": "Last night's news: 38 percent of Northwesterners think Mayor Chickenfucker should resign immediately, another 8 percent are too befuddled to have an opinion, so though too many Mellow Northwesterners do seem rather to like being the chickenfucker's chicken, many others feel kinda bad about it.."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99854a5c-8438-44c9-81ab-d6f81881b51e",
                                                "sense_id": "e24e2ec2-dc89-3ac2-9360-f84ddc289909",
                                                "text": "Was Nort pretty sure that he knew what a chickenfucker was? Was he troubled as to how such a personage managed to relate to his feathered companions, in, that is, a meaningful way?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
